feat(ai): create Kinescope video activities from the AI tools and MCP

create_media_activity and build_course know youtube, video and pdf. An agent
building a course over MCP cannot add a Kinescope video as a video activity:
kind=youtube rejects the link and kind=video tries to download the page.

Add kind="kinescope" to both. It validates a kinescope.io share or embed link
and creates the same external video activity as the dashboard (type
"kinescope", progress tracked by the video player). Tool descriptions and the
MCP server instructions name it, so agents pick it unprompted. The tools are
also REST operations, so the SDK schema (packages/sdk) is regenerated.

Covered by `test_courses.py` (create_media_activity stores the normalised link
and rejects a non-Kinescope one) and `test_course_build.py` (build_course plans
and creates a Kinescope activity).
